A0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickSys/MyBoard/commits/1dc5aaba475aba293b835dbc07c946e724b9e6d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T23:09:03Z","email":"74001504+PatrickSys@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Patrick Rosselló Colom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T23:09:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): command palette (Ctrl+K) + UI polish (#12)\n\n* feat(host): implement multi-page support with enhanced dashboard navigation\n\n- Introduced a new page management system allowing users to create, rename, and delete pages.\n- Added a top navigation bar with page tabs for easy switching between pages.\n- Implemented keyboard shortcuts for navigating between pages (Shift+[ and Shift+]).\n- Enhanced the dashboard layout to support individual page layouts and widget management.\n- Updated the Widget Marketplace to allow adding/removing widgets from specific pages.\n- Refactored dashboard components to utilize the new page store for state management.\n\n* feat(host): enhance dashboard layout and widget management\n\n- Introduced a new widget placement system allowing users to add widgets to specific slots.\n- Added a WidgetPicker for selecting and placing widgets within the dashboard.\n- Implemented a responsive layout adjustment for different screen sizes.\n- Enhanced WidgetSlot component with settings and delete actions for better widget management.\n- Improved global styles for grid slots and placement banners to enhance user experience.\n- Updated dashboard state management to handle widget placement and layout changes more effectively.\n\n* feat(host): add page settings panel and enhance grid layout\n\n- Introduced a new PageSettingsPanel for managing page-specific settings such as fixed height and widget title visibility.\n- Updated GridDashboard to integrate the new page settings functionality, allowing users to toggle fixed height and adjust title visibility.\n- Enhanced the grid layout to support 8 columns for improved widget arrangement and responsiveness.\n- Improved global styles for better user experience, including adjustments to padding and layout behavior.\n- Added unit and integration tests for new features to ensure stability and functionality.\n\n* feat(host): add command palette (Ctrl+K) with grouped commands and UI polish\n\n- Add useCommandRegistry hook: builds Command[] from app state across\n  Navigation/Pages/Widgets/Layout/Settings/Dev groups with shortcut hints\n- Add CommandPalette component: search input, grouped results, keyboard nav\n  (↑↓/Tab/Enter/Esc), auto-scroll, hover selection; follows WidgetPicker\n  animation pattern (double-rAF, 200ms CSS transition)\n- Add DashboardHeader.module.scss: kbdChip style for ⌘K hint button\n- GridDashboard: wire Ctrl+K/Cmd+K toggle (bypasses isTyping guard),\n  render CommandPalette, pass onOpenCommandPalette to header\n- DashboardHeader: ⌘K chip in action bar, myboard:start-page-rename\n  custom event listener for palette→inline-rename flow, Ctrl+K entry\n  in shortcuts popover","tree":{"sha":"e5cf29178b63ac2610bbe400d6d6f7ad8d165065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickSys/MyBoard/git/trees/e5cf29178b63ac2610bbe400d6d6f7ad8d165065"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickSys/MyBoard/git/commits/1dc5aaba475aba293b835dbc07c946e724b9e6d4","verification":{"payload":"tree e5cf29178b63ac2610bbe400d6d6f7ad8d165065\nparent d891a2b3a482cb8f1e5a9e4bd92cf4e5d43094bf\nauthor Patrick Rosselló Colom <74001504+PatrickS