nSorting order within each column (stable, no user action needed):\n  1. Overdue tasks (past due) — most critical first, then by due date asc\n  2. Due-soon tasks (today/tomorrow/day-after) — by due date asc\n  3. Normal due date tasks — by due date asc\n  4. No due date tasks — by priority (high→low), then newest first\n\nWithin each bucket, priority (high→medium→low) breaks ties before\nfalling back to creation time descending.\n\nLayout: due date row now appears directly below the title, above the\npriority pill + created-time meta row, so the most actionable info\nis read top-to-bottom in order of importance.","tree":{"sha":"9863d2c2412b03eccc9848478365863c6d1a73cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickSys/MyBoard/git/trees/9863d2c2412b03eccc9848478365863c6d1a73cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickSys/MyBoard/git/commits/8f3cc1159550558c5af35f3ffa79ced58e42ffbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74001504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PatrickSys","id":74001504,"login":"PatrickSys","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDAxNTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PatrickSys","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c